abic.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n1081"},{"text":"[^n1082]: Same word in Arabic.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n1082"},{"text":"[^n1083]: Luke vii. 47.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n1083"},{"text":"[^n1084]: Luke vii. 48.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n1084"},{"text":"[^n1085]: Luke vii. 49.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n1085"},{"text":"[^n1086]: Luke vii. 50.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n1086"},{"text":"[^n1087]: John ii. 23b.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n1087"},{"text":"[^n1088]: John ii. 24.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n1088"},{"text":"[^n1089]: The meaning is not apparent.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n1089"},{"text":"[^n1090]: John ii. 25.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n1090"},{"text":"[^n1091]: Luke x. 1.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n1091"},{"text":"[^n1092]: Luke x. 2.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n1092"},{"text":"[^n1093]: Luke x. 3.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n1093"},{"text":"[^n1094]: Luke x. 4.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n1094"},{"text":"[^n1095]: Luke x. 5.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n1095"},{"text":"[^n1096]: Luke x. 6.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n1096"},{"text":"[^n1097]: Luke x. 7.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n1097"},{"text":"[^n1098]: cf. Syriac versions.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n1098"},{"text":"[^n1099]: Luke x. 8.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n1099"},{"text":"[^n1100]: Luke x. 9.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n1100"},{"text":"[^n1101]: Luke x. 10.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n1101"},{"text":"[^n1102]: Luke x. 11.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n1102"},{"text":"[^n1103]: The first letter of the word has been lost.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n1103"},{"text":"[^n1104]: Lit. that, as often in this work.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n1104"},{"text":"[^n1105]: Luke x. 12.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n1105"},{"text":"[^n1106]: Matt. xi. 20.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n1106"},{"text":"[^n1107]: Lit. powers.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n1107"},{"text":"[^n1108]: Matt. xi. 21.","kind"